                {battle.paleEmperor && <section className="slice-notice" aria-label="苍白皇帝本回合实际资源"><h3>本人、原器具与当前可见条件</h3><p>本人健康{state.health}/{state.maxHealth} · 精神{state.mind}/{state.maxMind} · 灵性{state.spirituality}/{state.maxSpirituality}。</p><p>{battle.paleEmperor.enemyName}：健康{battle.paleEmperor.enemyHealth}、精神{battle.paleEmperor.enemyMind}、灵性{battle.paleEmperor.enemySpirituality}；原棍{battle.paleEmperor.weaponLocation === "HAND" ? "仍在对手手中" : "留在原平台"}，原灵印{battle.paleEmperor.materials.marks.remaining}。</p><p>原棍剩余光击原灵印{battle.paleEmperor.materials.marks.remaining}；同一原遮屏影响当前视线，旧年代的原灵和器物没有搬入本场。</p><p>本次策略：{battle.paleEmperor.policy==='ALL'?'全部实际能力':battle.paleEmperor.policy==='INHERITED_ONLY'?'仅继承能力':battle.paleEmperor.policy==='RESIDUAL_QUIETING'?'残响安定':battle.paleEmperor.policy==='SPIRITUAL_INTERDICTION'?'灵迹阻隔':'普通行动'}。交战中保持本次选择。</p><ul>{battle.paleEmperor.facts.map((fact,index)=><li key={index}>{fact}</li>)}</ul><PaleEmperorActionSequence actions={battle.paleEmperor.lastActionSequence}/></section>}
                {battle.pureWhiteAngel && <section className="slice-notice" aria-label="纯白天使本回合实际资源"><h3>本人、原器具与当前可见条件</h3><p>本人健康{state.health}/{state.maxHealth} · 精神{state.mind}/{state.maxMind} · 灵性{state.spirituality}/{state.maxSpirituality}。</p><p>{battle.pureWhiteAngel.enemyName}：健康{battle.pureWhiteAngel.enemyHealth}、精神{battle.pureWhiteAngel.enemyMind}、灵性{battle.pureWhiteAngel.enemySpirituality}；原杆{battle.pureWhiteAngel.weaponLocation === "HAND" ? "仍在对手手中" : "留在原平台"}，储能{battle.pureWhiteAngel.materials.weapon.charge}。</p><p>原杆剩余光击储能{battle.pureWhiteAngel.materials.weapon.charge}；同一遮罩影响当前视线，原廊的灯油与装置没有搬入本场。</p><p>本次策略：{battle.pureWhiteAngel.policy==='ALL'?'全部实际能力':battle.pureWhiteAngel.policy==='INHERITED_ONLY'?'仅继承能力':battle.pureWhiteAngel.policy==='FOCUSED_PURIFICATION'?'净光定向':battle.pureWhiteAngel.policy==='WARM_RADIANCE_GUARD'?'温光护持':'普通行动'}。交战中保持本次选择。</p><ul>{battle.pureWhiteAngel.facts.map((fact,index)=><li key={index}>{fact}</li>)}</ul><PureWhiteAngelActionSequence actions={battle.pureWhiteAngel.lastActionSequence}/></section>}
                {battle.thunderGod && <section className="slice-notice" aria-label="雷神本回合实际资源"><h3>本人、原器具与当前可见条件</h3><p>本人健康{state.health}/{state.maxHealth} · 精神{state.mind}/{state.maxMind} · 灵性{state.spirituality}/{state.maxSpirituality}。</p><p>{battle.thunderGod.enemyName}：健康{battle.thunderGod.enemyHealth}、精神{battle.thunderGod.enemyMind}、灵性{battle.thunderGod.enemySpirituality}；原杆{battle.thunderGod.weaponLocation === "HAND" ? "仍在对手手中" : "留在原平台"}，储能{battle.thunderGod.materials.weapon.charge}。</p><p>原杆剩余雷击储能{battle.thunderGod.materials.weapon.charge}；同一遮罩影响当前视线，旧湾的水与装置没有搬入本场。</p><p>本次策略：{battle.thunderGod.policy==='ALL'?'全部实际能力':battle.thunderGod.policy==='INHERITED_ONLY'?'仅继承能力':battle.thunderGod.policy==='GUIDED_THUNDER'?'雷势引导':battle.thunderGod.policy==='STORM_BRACE'?'风雷护持':'普通行动'}。交战中保持本次选择。</p><ul>{battle.thunderGod.facts.map((fact,index)=><li key={index}>{fact}</li>)}</ul><ThunderGodActionSequence actions={battle.thunderGod.lastActionSequence}/></section>}
                {battle.abomination && <section className="slice-notice" aria-label="神孽本回合实际资源"><h3>本人、有限辅助片与已付力量</h3><p>本人健康{state.health}/{state.maxHealth} · 精神{state.mind}/{state.maxMind} · 灵性{state.spirituality}/{state.maxSpirituality}。</p><p>{battle.abomination.enemyName}：健康{battle.abomination.enemyHealth}、精神{battle.abomination.enemyMind}、灵性{battle.abomination.enemySpirituality}。</p><p>辅助片剩余{battle.abomination.piece?.charges ?? 0}次，磨损{battle.abomination.piece?.wear ?? 0}；未用窗口会随时间和现场变化失效，已经支付的费用不返还。</p><p>{battle.abomination.summary}</p></section>}
                {battle.uncleanMonarch && <section className="slice-notice" aria-label="污秽君王本回合实际资源"><h3>本人、有限辅助片与已付力量</h3><p>本人健康{state.health}/{state.maxHealth} · 精神{state.mind}/{state.maxMind} · 灵性{state.spirituality}/{state.maxSpirituality}。</p><p>{battle.uncleanMonarch.enemyName}：健康{battle.uncleanMonarch.enemyHealth}、精神{battle.uncleanMonarch.enemyMind}、灵性{battle.uncleanMonarch.enemySpirituality}。</p><p>辅助片剩余{battle.uncleanMonarch.piece?.charges ?? 0}次，磨损{battle.uncleanMonarch.piece?.wear ?? 0}；未用窗口会随时间和现场变化失效，已经支付的费用不返还。</p><p>{battle.uncleanMonarch.summary}</p></section>}
                {battle.darkAngel && <section className="slice-notice" aria-label="暗天使本回合实际资源"><h3>本人、有限封条与已付力量</h3><p>本人健康{state.health}/{state.maxHealth} · 精神{state.mind}/{state.maxMind} · 灵性{state.spirituality}/{state.maxSpirituality}。</p><p>{battle.darkAngel.enemyName}：健康{battle.darkAngel.enemyHealth}、精神{battle.darkAngel.enemyMind}、灵性{battle.darkAngel.enemySpirituality}。</p><p>新封条剩余{battle.darkAngel.note?.charges ?? 0}次，磨损{battle.darkAngel.note?.wear ?? 0}；未用窗口会随时间和现场变化失效，已经支付的费用不返还。</p><p>{battle.darkAngel.summary}</p></section>}
                {battle.knowledgeEmperor && <section className="slice-notice" aria-label="知识皇帝本回合实际资源"><h3>本人、有限便笺与已付力量</h3><p>本人健康{state.health}/{state.maxHealth} · 精神{state.mind}/{state.maxMind} · 灵性{state.spirituality}/{state.maxSpirituality}。</p><p>{battle.knowledgeEmperor.enemyName}：健康{battle.knowledgeEmperor.enemyHealth}、精神{battle.knowledgeEmperor.enemyMind}、灵性{battle.knowledgeEmperor.enemySpirituality}。</p><p>新便笺剩余{battle.knowledgeEmperor.note?.charges ?? 0}次，磨损{battle.knowledgeEmperor.note?.wear ?? 0}；未用窗口会随时间和现场变化失效，已经支付的费用不返还。</p><p>{battle.knowledgeEmperor.summary}</p></section>}
                {battle.apocalypseDemoness && <section className="slice-notice" aria-label="末日魔女本回合实际资源"><h3>本人、原片与当前可见条件</h3><p>本人健康{state.health}/{state.maxHealth} · 精神{state.mind}/{state.maxMind} · 灵性{state.spirituality}/{state.maxSpirituality}。</p><p>{battle.apocalypseDemoness.enemyName}：健康{battle.apocalypseDemoness.enemyHealth}、精神{battle.apocalypseDemoness.enemyMind}、灵性{battle.apocalypseDemoness.enemySpirituality}。</p><p>护持只能应对随后实际可见的身体冲击；遮挡条件、镜片与材料耗损会影响能否生效，已经发生的伤害不会撤回。</p><ul>{battle.apocalypseDemoness.facts.map((fact,index)=><li key={index}>{playerText(fact)}</li>)}</ul><ApocalypseDemonessActionSequence actions={battle.apocalypseDemoness.lastActionSequence}/></section>}
                {battle.divineHand && <section className="slice-notice" aria-label="神明之手本回合实际资源"><h3>本人、原甲与当前接触条件</h3><p>本人健康{state.health}/{state.maxHealth} · 精神{state.mind}/{state.maxMind} · 灵性{state.spirituality}/{state.maxSpirituality}。</p><p>{battle.divineHand.enemyName}：健康{battle.divineHand.enemyHealth}、精神{battle.divineHand.enemyMind}、灵性{battle.divineHand.enemySpirituality}。</p><p>护持只能应对随后实际可见的身体冲击；接触条件、护甲与材料耗损会影响能否生效，已经发生的伤害不会撤回。</p><ul>{battle.divineHand.facts.map((fact,index)=><li key={index}>{playerText(fact)}</li>)}</ul><DivineHandActionSequence actions={battle.divineHand.lastActionSequence}/></section>}
                {battle.timeWorm && <section className="slice-notice" aria-label="时之虫本回合实际资源"><h3>本人、尚未执行动作与剩余时段</h3><p>本人健康{state.health}/{state.maxHealth} · 精神{state.mind}/{state.maxMind} · 灵性{state.spirituality}/{state.maxSpirituality}。</p><p>{battle.timeWorm.enemyName}：健康{battle.timeWorm.enemyHealth}、精神{battle.timeWorm.enemyMind}、灵性{battle.timeWorm.enemySpirituality}。</p><p>短窃只影响尚未执行的原动作；释放须实际持有尚未耗尽的短暂时段，消耗不会取消目标已承受的延迟。既成伤害和本周行动不会倒回。</p><ul>{battle.timeWorm.facts.map((fact,index)=><li key={index}>{fact}</li>)}</ul><TimeWormActionSequence actions={battle.timeWorm.lastActionSequence}/></section>}
                {battle.starKey && <section className="slice-notice" aria-label="星之匙本回合实际资源"><h3>本人、真实端点与当前可见条件</h3><p>本人健康{state.health}/{state.maxHealth} · 精神{state.mind}/{state.maxMind} · 灵性{state.spirituality}/{state.maxSpirituality}。</p><p>{battle.starKey.enemyName}：健康{battle.starKey.enemyHealth}、精神{battle.starKey.enemyMind}、灵性{battle.starKey.enemySpirituality}。</p><p>定位与维系只适用于当前已经观察的条件；遮挡、移位或时限到达会使原窗口失效。</p><ul>{battle.starKey.facts.map((fact,index)=><li key={index}>{fact}</li>)}</ul><StarKeyActionSequence actions={battle.starKey.lastActionSequence}/></section>}
                {battle.allKnowingEye && <section className="slice-notice" aria-label="全知之眼本回合实际资源"><h3>本人、原器具与当前可见条件</h3><p>本人健康{state.health}/{state.maxHealth} · 精神{state.mind}/{state.maxMind} · 灵性{state.spirituality}/{state.maxSpirituality}。</p><p>{battle.allKnowingEye.enemyName}：健康{battle.allKnowingEye.enemyHealth}、精神{battle.allKnowingEye.enemyMind}、灵性{battle.allKnowingEye.enemySpirituality}；原杆{battle.allKnowingEye.weaponLocation === "HAND" ? "仍在对手手中" : "留在原院中"}，储能{battle.allKnowingEye.materials.weapon.charge}。</p><p>仍持有的原微光片：{battle.allKnowingEye.remainingCraftIds.join('、')||'已耗尽'}。观察与预判只适用于现场实际条件，旧装置不会因此充能。</p><p>本次策略：{battle.allKnowingEye.policy==='ALL'?'全部实际能力':battle.allKnowingEye.policy==='INHERITED_ONLY'?'仅继承能力':battle.allKnowingEye.policy==='BOUNDED_INSIGHT'?'现场洞察':battle.allKnowingEye.policy==='PENDING_FORECAST'?'先机预判':'普通行动'}。交战中保持本次选择。</p><ul>{battle.allKnowingEye.facts.map((fact,index)=><li key={index}>{fact}</li>)}</ul><AllKnowingEyeActionSequence actions={battle.allKnowingEye.lastActionSequence}/></section>}
                {battle.misfortuneKnight && <section className="slice-notice" aria-label="厄难骑士本回合实际资源"><h3>原身体、实板与同一封叶</h3><p>本人健康{state.health}/{state.maxHealth} · 精神{state.mind}/{state.maxMind} · 灵性{state.spirituality}/{state.maxSpirituality}。</p><p>{battle.misfortuneKnight.enemyName}：健康{battle.misfortuneKnight.enemyHealth}、精神{battle.misfortuneKnight.enemyMind}、灵性{battle.misfortuneKnight.enemySpirituality}；原杆{battle.misfortuneKnight.weaponLocation === "HAND" ? "仍在对手手中" : "留在原院中"}，储能{battle.misfortuneKnight.materials.weapon.charge}。</p><p>同一封叶已派出{battle.misfortuneKnight.companion.deployments}次、收回{battle.misfortuneKnight.companion.recalls}次。战场木板{battle.misfortuneKnight.materials.plate ? `完整度${battle.misfortuneKnight.materials.plate.integrity}` : '尚未购买'}。</p><p>本次策略：{battle.misfortuneKnight.policy==='ALL'?'全部实际能力':battle.misfortuneKnight.policy==='INHERITED_ONLY'?'仅继承能力':battle.misfortuneKnight.policy==='GUIDED_MISHAP'?'厄势导引':battle.misfortuneKnight.policy==='BOUNDED_NIGHT_GUARD'?'隐夜护持':'普通行动'}。交战中保持本次选择。</p><ul>{battle.misfortuneKnight.facts.map((fact,index)=><li key={index}>{fact}</li>)}</ul><MisfortuneKnightActionSequence actions={battle.misfortuneKnight.lastActionSequence}/></section>}
                {battle.beautyGoddess && <section className="slice-notice" aria-label="美神本回合实际资源"><h3>原身体、实灯与有限月片</h3><p>本人健康{state.health}/{state.maxHealth} · 精神{state.mind}/{state.maxMind} · 灵性{state.spirituality}/{state.maxSpirituality}。</p><p>{battle.beautyGoddess.enemyName}：健康{battle.beautyGoddess.enemyHealth}、精神{battle.beautyGoddess.enemyMind}、灵性{battle.beautyGoddess.enemySpirituality}；原杆{battle.beautyGoddess.weaponLocation === "HAND" ? "仍在对手手中" : "留在原石坪"}。</p><p>流灯仍在原家，健康{battle.beautyGoddess.partner.health}、精神{battle.beautyGoddess.partner.mind}、精力{battle.beautyGoddess.partner.stamina}。原纸可用{battle.beautyGoddess.papers.filter(p=>p.status==='PREPARED').length}张。</p><p>原杆剩余储能{battle.beautyGoddess.materials.weapon.charge}；实灯{battle.beautyGoddess.materials.lamp ? `${battle.beautyGoddess.materials.lamp.fuelSeconds}秒灯油，${battle.beautyGoddess.materials.lamp.lit?'已点亮':'已熄灭'}，${battle.beautyGoddess.materials.lamp.blocked?'遮挡':'通光'}` : '未购买'}。</p><ul>{battle.beautyGoddess.materials.pieces.map(x=><li key={x.id}>{x.id}：{x.status==='READY'?'未使用':'已消耗'}；{x.location==='RETURN_TRAY'?'原返还盘':x.location==='YARD'?'交战原处':'本人携带'}。</li>)}{battle.beautyGoddess.facts.map((fact,index)=><li key={index}>{fact}</li>)}</ul><p>本次已选策略：{battle.beautyGoddess.policy==='ALL'?'全部实际能力':battle.beautyGoddess.policy==='INHERITED_ONLY'?'仅继承能力':battle.beautyGoddess.policy==='SELF_POISE'?'辉映调息':battle.beautyGoddess.policy==='BOUNDED_MOONFORM'?'月辉定形':'普通行动'}。本场交战中保持该选择。</p><BeautyGoddessActionSequence actions={battle.beautyGoddess.lastActionSequence}/></section>}
