                {battle.writer && <section className="slice-notice" aria-label="作家本回合实际资源"><h3>原身体与尚未发生的动作</h3><p>本人健康{state.health}/{state.maxHealth} · 精神{state.mind}/{state.maxMind} · 灵性{state.spirituality}/{state.maxSpirituality}。</p><p>{battle.writer.enemyName}：健康{battle.writer.enemyHealth}、精神{battle.writer.enemyMind}、灵性{battle.writer.enemySpirituality}；原杖{battle.writer.weaponLocation === "HAND" ? "仍在对手手中" : "留在原石坪"}。</p><ul>{battle.writer.facts.map((fact,index)=><li key={index}>{fact}</li>)}</ul><p>入场前选择：{battle.writer.policy === 'HOLD' ? '保留两项新能力' : battle.writer.policy === 'BOTH' ? '允许两项有限能力' : battle.writer.policy === 'RECIPROCAL_INSIGHT' ? '允许互知线索' : '允许合理安排'}。本场按已保存策略结算。</p><WriterActionSequence actions={battle.writer.lastActionSequence}/></section>}
